RocketSim-CUDA V3

This project is a C++ and CUDA port of RocketSim v0.3.5 (Rust), created by
ZealanL and ported to Rust by VirxEC (https://github.com/ZealanL/RocketSim,
MIT License, see LICENSE). RocketSim's physics are derived from the Bullet
Physics library.

